SUMMARY:Scholarship Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:We’re thrilled to invite you to our annual fundraiser\, FUTURE IN FOCUS—an evening dedicated to celebrating our mission\, our community\, and the bright future we’re building together. Our goal is to raise $25\,000 for our scholarship program to advance girls’ education. \nThis year’s event is on Thursday\, April 30th at the beautiful The Highlawn in West Orange\, NJ\, where you’ll see a breathtaking view of the New York City skyline. \nEnjoy: \nDelicious food\, including gluten‑free options – hors d’oeuvres\, various dishes\, and outstanding desserts.\nRefreshing beverages – soda\, tea\, and coffee included. Cash bar available.\nA silent auction – featuring exceptional items and experiences.\nLive entertainment – DanceWorks Studios\, recently featured in the movie “The Housemaid.”\nA thoughtful gift bag – prepared with our guests in mind. \nYour generosity fuels our mission\, and this night is an opportunity to celebrate the progress we’ve made together and the future we’re striving toward. We would be honored to have you with us for this meaningful evening. Together we can keep the future in focus. \nFor more information and tickets\, click here: https://rebrand.ly/3eg2i2a \nWe’re really looking forward to seeing you! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/scholarship-fundraiser/
LOCATION:The Highlawn\, 1 Crest Drive\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Future-in-Focus-2026-Flyer.png
