SUMMARY:The Moving Parts live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Operating like a well-oiled machine\, The Moving Parts return to Montclair Brewery with their unique mix of Rock\, Alternative\, Funk\, Soul\, and so many genres in between! Their sound is cohesive and refined to the point of allowing spontaneous improvisation\, making each performance original and full of surprises. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
