SUMMARY:5th Annual Lamp for Haiti 5K Run/Walk
DESCRIPTION:Lace up your sneakers and get ready to participate in the 5th Annual Lamp for Haiti 5K Run/Walk\, happening on May 3\, 2026\, at Branch Brook Park in Newark\, NJ. This event is designed for all ages and abilities\, making it the perfect opportunity for everyone—whether you are aiming for a new personal record\, seeking a leisurely walk around the park\, or looking to connect with the community while supporting a meaningful cause. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
